# Frontend

Functional components. TypeScript **strict**. No `any`.

## Components

- One component per section file. `App.tsx` composes them. No layout framework.
- Extract a child only when it clarifies the parent or is used twice.
- Stories: a typed array in `src/data/stories.ts` once content exists — not hardcoded JSX blobs, not a mini-CMS.
- No React Router, global state, or context for this page.

## Tailwind

- Utility classes in JSX. `index.css` holds `@font-face` (via fontsource), CSS variables, texture, and Tailwind entry — not a second stylesheet per component.
- Colors and type come from CDTM tokens (`docs/brand.md`). No raw hex in components. Set `font-sans` (Inter) on `body` once. Headings are Montserrat (`font-heading` / element defaults). No `font-extrabold` or `font-black`.
- Mobile-first. `sm` / `md` / `lg` as needed. No breakpoint soup. No horizontal scroll.

## Icons

```tsx
import { ArrowRight } from "@phosphor-icons/react";

<ArrowRight size={24} weight="regular" />
```

Phosphor only (`@phosphor-icons/react`). Default `weight="regular"`. `currentColor`. Don't mix in Lucide, Heroicons, or SVGs-as-icons unless it's a CDTM logo asset.

## Motion

CSS / Tailwind first (`transition`, `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`). A motion library only after suggesting it and getting a yes.

## Don't

Wrong: raw hex, unshipped weight, extra icon pack.

```tsx
<h1 className="text-[#004EA8] font-extrabold">Four Letters</h1>
import { ArrowRight } from "lucide-react";
```

Right: token class, shipped weight, Phosphor.

```tsx
<h1 className="text-cdtm-brand font-bold">Four Letters</h1>
import { ArrowRight } from "@phosphor-icons/react";
```

Color class names live in `docs/brand.md` (`text-cdtm-brand`, `bg-cdtm-neutral`, …). Don't invent a parallel palette (`cdtm-ice`, `cdtm-lime`, …).
